signalsmith-linear 0.6.4 (https://github.com/Signalsmith-Audio/linear, tag 0.6.4) — the version pinned by
Signalsmith Stretch 1.4.0's CMakeLists. Licence: MIT (LICENSE.txt). Unmodified headers; tests/ not vendored.
